{"id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","title":"Standard Real Topology and Borel Structures","display":"df-standard-real-topology — Standard Real Topology and Borel Structures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-standard-real-topology","aliases":["58-df-standard-real-topology"],"display":"df-standard-real-topology — Standard Real Topology and Borel Structures","depends_on":["[[58-df-reals.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-standard-real-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-standard-real-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-standard-real-topology — Standard Real Topology and Borel Structures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals.md\">58-df-reals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R,\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb R,\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 使用书内实数、有理数及其规范序与算术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S,\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S,\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S,\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S,\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\([0,\\infty]=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\">\\(\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;(r&lt;\\infty)\">\\(\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;(r&lt;\\infty)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau=\\left\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl(|y-x|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal B=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal B=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}\\left(\n\\left\\{\\{x\\in[0,\\infty]:q&lt;x\\}:q\\in\\mathbb Q\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau=\\left\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl(|y-x|&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal B=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal B=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}\\left(\n\\left\\{\\{x\\in[0,\\infty]:q&lt;x\\}:q\\in\\mathbb Q\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里固定调用者已经指定的通常实拓扑及 Borel 结构，不限制其他文件中作为自由参数使用的一般拓扑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)$ 与 $\\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)$ 使用 [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R,\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S,\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S,\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"[0,\\infty]=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;(r<\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&X\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\\\\n&\\land\\tau=\\left\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl(|y-x|<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R,\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StandardRealBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{StandardRealTopology}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal B=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal B=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}\\left(\n\\left\\{\\{x\\in[0,\\infty]:q<x\\}:q\\in\\mathbb Q\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1856,"backlinks":[{"id":"6067389cc689812f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{